  "sims": "1,000 cats per bot, 1,000 eval simulations each (MC seed 777000+k); luckiest cats re-simulated with 5,000 fresh runs",
  "seeds": "cat k on bot i uses paw seed 1e6*(i+1)+k (mulberry32); search cats 9e8 + rep*1000 + i",
